{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OLAPU is a fast-paced co-op action roguelite in which you and three other of your friends can team up to face escalating waves of enemies and massive raid-style bosses. Each run is a race to power up, survive and prove that you are worthy taking down the strongest entities in the realm.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/ff71c6317c7ccd77c39d89ef06e60c6d.avif?t=1761319950\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras_big/ff71c6317c7ccd77c39d89ef06e60c6d.webp?t=1761319950 width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a wide variety of characters be it melee or ranged, support or pure damage dealer. Each character has their own unique attacks, abilities and ultimates. The more you play them, the more they evolve, unlocking exclusive upgrades that change how they fight and build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/214d89bb7d0630b1d8d01e407c6790a1.poster.avif?t=1761319950\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/214d89bb7d0630b1d8d01e407c6790a1.webm?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/214d89bb7d0630b1d8d01e407c6790a1.mp4?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/1c2cafb9bcf1b3cf2877358755f8774c.avif?t=1761319950\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras_big/1c2cafb9bcf1b3cf2877358755f8774c.webp?t=1761319950 width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you defeat enemies you collect stars which you can turn in for pieces of constellations. These unlock many things from summons to chain reactions and even a little cat casino! There are many dozens of choices for each run, no two feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/f470298bad0c184013e724b3e909d44c.poster.avif?t=1761319950\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/f470298bad0c184013e724b3e909d44c.webm?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/f470298bad0c184013e724b3e909d44c.mp4?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/fe5db2839d6cf1ce13c7ac4014673729.avif?t=1761319950\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras_big/fe5db2839d6cf1ce13c7ac4014673729.webp?t=1761319950 width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses are designed like raids in MMORPGs. Multi-phase, movement heavy and merciless. You will need to learn patterns, mechanics and adapt on the fly in order to defeat them. These fights will demand the focus of you and your party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/2b58f07cc0967732caa77804e9330da1.poster.avif?t=1761319950\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/2b58f07cc0967732caa77804e9330da1.webm?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/2b58f07cc0967732caa77804e9330da1.mp4?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/b9f1df9fb65bb7e1c3c11a8223629360.avif?t=1761319950\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras_big/b9f1df9fb65bb7e1c3c11a8223629360.webp?t=1761319950 width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs you'll unlock new characters for your roster as well as evolutions for them, unlock permanent skills that improve you in various ways, unbox legendary gear with semi-random stats, buffs for runs in the form of food and many cosmetics for you and your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/4c717ca725dce549d14eb44285a7c380.poster.avif?t=1761319950\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/4c717ca725dce549d14eb44285a7c380.webm?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/4c717ca725dce549d14eb44285a7c380.mp4?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Empress Elysera, Daughter of Aurelia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/64badf370283dca4a9099463492d7d3dc102398e.jpg"},{"name":"Seraphine, Guardian of Elysera's Valley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/14dfe2033b9a28e0da5dc9c295d9d9f9c75d9228.jpg"},{"name":"Elysera's Valley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/4c7b72f70833b19aa7ca3f72694c124a539d48e4.jpg"},{"name":"Mi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/2889d27cc9d8877e8ffdf53857a209fd29199869.jpg"},{"name":"Chii","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/250fb848c8287fd11904047cf0a62f66439367a1.jpg"},{"name":"Yuvi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/158c302abbee85eb1921a56c3f01e0390188b1fd.jpg"},{"name":"Tavi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/fd61579a33aae625cf6f057aead6d0c758030dc7.jpg"},{"name":"Qingwa","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/632219f8a7bf6507474ef9168992c3390712bde8.jpg"},{"name":"Kana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/4e08c24fe0c5715c1ba5b0dadd6674d5c15b46b5.jpg"},{"name":"Zuleika","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3331590/0b6554bcbaa25946863ec9ea240a43a90c5089d5.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331590?t=1761319950","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3331590?t=1761319950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/48fd421dac2cb8aa1d8cadcec0339fe68b5d8967/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761319950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/48fd421dac2cb8aa1d8cadcec0339fe68b5d8967/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761319950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achi