s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/1c2cafb9bcf1b3cf2877358755f8774c.avif?t=1761319950\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras_big/1c2cafb9bcf1b3cf2877358755f8774c.webp?t=1761319950 width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you defeat enemies you collect stars which you can turn in for pieces of constellations. These unlock many things from summons to chain reactions and even a little cat casino! There are many dozens of choices for each run, no two feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/f470298bad0c184013e724b3e909d44c.poster.avif?t=1761319950\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/f470298bad0c184013e724b3e909d44c.webm?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/f470298bad0c184013e724b3e909d44c.mp4?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/fe5db2839d6cf1ce13c7ac4014673729.avif?t=1761319950\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras_big/fe5db2839d6cf1ce13c7ac4014673729.webp?t=1761319950 width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses are designed like raids in MMORPGs. Multi-phase, movement heavy and merciless. You will need to learn patterns, mechanics and adapt on the fly in order to defeat them. These fights will demand the focus of you and your party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/2b58f07cc0967732caa77804e9330da1.poster.avif?t=1761319950\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/2b58f07cc0967732caa77804e9330da1.webm?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/2b58f07cc0967732caa77804e9330da1.mp4?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/b9f1df9fb65bb7e1c3c11a8223629360.avif?t=1761319950\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras_big/b9f1df9fb65bb7e1c3c11a8223629360.webp?t=1761319950 width=1600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between runs you'll unlock new characters for your roster as well as evolutions for them, unlock permanent skills that improve you in various ways, unbox legendary gear with semi-random stats, buffs for runs in the form of food and many cosmetics for you and your characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/4c717ca725dce549d14eb44285a7c380.poster.avif?t=1761319950\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/4c717ca725dce549d14eb44285a7c380.webm?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331590/extras/4c717ca725dce549d14eb44285a7c380.mp4?t=1761319950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["bati","dxriiia"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"des